  "duration_s": 361.517241,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上一集说到袁隆平四年心血培育的七百多株秧苗一夜被拔光，他在一口废井里捞出仅存的五株，擦干眼泪，从头再来，你知道从头再来，有多难吗？为了抢时间，他带着团队开始了长达十几年的南返北遇。冬天去海南，夏天回湖南，追着温度跑，追着生长季跑一年。当两年连用坐三十多个小时的绿皮硬座挤在人堆里，腿肿的脱不下裤子。饿了肯干磨，渴了喝凉水，从来没说过一句苦。一九七零年十一月，他的助手李碧湖在海南岛一片沼泽地里，发现了一株极为罕见的野生雄性捕。遇到袁隆平给他取名叫野草，就是这株不起眼的野草，彻底打开了杂交水稻研究的大门。三年后，一九七三年，袁隆平正式宣布，中国先行杂交水稻三系配套成功，整个农业界震惊了。那一年，他四十三岁，一九七六年杂交水稻开始在全国大面积推广，数据是最狠的语言。亩产从普通水稻的三百公斤一路突破五百六百字，后来屡创新高到上世纪末，中国用不到世界百分之九的耕地，养活了世界百分之二十二的人口，这是震撼世界的伟大奇迹。可当年美国人傲慢的很，说中国人口太多，没有哪个国家能解决吃饭问题，中国人至少一半得饿死。袁隆平听了没争辩，一头扎进稻田，最后稻香飘遍神州，老外的断言成了笑话。育种成功之后，美国一家种子公司开出天价，想买杂交水稻的技术专利，袁隆平却拒绝。他说，这是中国的技术，不是我个人的技术，他反而把技术无偿传授给越南、菲律宾、印度、巴基斯坦等几十个发展中国家。有人说他傻，他说饥饿没有国界，种子没有国籍。很多人以为功成名就之后，他该退休了，结果呢八十岁还在田里插秧九十岁，还天天看天气预报，关心稻田长势。他有两个梦，全世界都知道，一个是河下乘凉梦梦见水稻，长得像高粱一样高，穗子像扫帚一样大。他和同事都坐在稻穗下面乘凉，另一个是杂交水稻覆盖全球梦，让饥饿从地球上彻底消失。可你知道他自己过的什么日子吗？穿十几块钱的衬衫破了补补，继续穿脚上的皮鞋磨白了还在穿。记者采访时问他他低头看了看，说，能走路就行，又不找对象。国家给的上千万奖金，他全部捐出去，成立了基金奖励搞农业的年轻的科研。后辈这辈子没给自己买过一套房，一直住在单位分的老家属楼里，他有个雷打不动的习惯，每天天还没亮，就打着手电筒去看稻田，看叶子上的露水，看稻穗抽出来，没有他管，这叫跟道子问。早安。二零二一年五月二十二号，九十一岁的袁隆平在长沙离世了，就有了开头那一幕，老百姓自发涌上街头，捧着菊花，抱着稻穗送他最后一程。他研究的杂交水稻迄今累计推广超过八十亿亩，增产粮食六千多亿公斤。可他自己的一辈子跟泥土打交道，一辈子在太阳底下弯腰一辈子没为自己活过一天。我们这一代人是有史以来最少挨过饿的中国人，很多人觉得吃饱饭是理所当然的，可这份理所当然的背后，站着一个弯腰在稻田里度过了一生的老人。下次端起碗的时候，记得他记得那粒种子，记得那个梦，记得那个叫袁隆平的人用一辈子喂饱了一个时代的我们，其实元老只是国之脊梁。这本书里，四十位科学家中的一位书里还有很多人。名字，你可能头一回听说，有人隐姓埋名几十年搞原子弹，有人在废井里捞秧苗。有人把国家讲的房子改成实验室，他们干的是惊天动地过的日子。普普通通这本书不是什么高高在上的名人传记，是四十个普通人。用一辈子告诉你一件事，人这一辈子，该为什么活着。家里有孩子，孩子的让他也读一读。如果你也被元老感动了，点个关注点个赞，收藏起来转发给身边的人，想把这四十个故事带回家的点击下方链接，就是这本国之脊梁。评论区留下一句元老，一路走好，算给老人家回个礼。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 6210,
      "text": "上一集说到袁隆平四年心血培育的七百多株秧苗一夜被拔光，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00002",
      "start_ms": 6930,
      "end_ms": 10330,
      "text": "他在一口废井里捞出仅存的五株，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00003",
      "start_ms": 10810,
      "end_ms": 11770,
      "text": "擦干眼泪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00004",
      "start_ms": 11950,
      "end_ms": 12850,
      "text": "从头再来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00005",
      "start_ms": 13510,
      "end_ms": 14770,
      "text": "你知道从头再来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00006",
      "start_ms": 14770,
      "end_ms": 15470,
      "text": "有多难吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15970,
      "end_ms": 17150,
      "text": "为了抢时间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00008",
      "start_ms": 17390,
      "end_ms": 22370,
      "text": "他带着团队开始了长达十几年的南返北遇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23030,
      "end_ms": 24270,
      "text": "冬天去海南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24390,
      "end_ms": 25590,
      "text": "夏天回湖南，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25830,
      "end_ms": 26850,
      "text": "追着温度跑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27290,
      "end_ms": 29310,
      "text": "追着生长季跑一年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29390,
      "end_ms": 34880,
      "text": "当两年连用坐三十多个小时的绿皮硬座挤在人堆里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34880,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "腿肿的脱不下裤子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00015",
      "start_ms": 36480,
      "end_ms": 37460,
      "text": "饿了肯干磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00016",
      "start_ms": 37820,
      "end_ms": 38720,
      "text": "渴了喝凉水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38980,
      "end_ms": 40640,
      "text": "从来没说过一句苦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 43220,
      "text": "一九七零年十一月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00019",
      "start_ms": 43400,
      "end_ms": 47820,
      "text": "他的助手李碧湖在海南岛一片沼泽地里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48600,
      "end_ms": 52660,
      "text": "发现了一株极为罕见的野生雄性捕。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52660,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "遇到袁隆平给他取名叫野草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56760,
      "end_ms": 58720,
      "text": "就是这株不起眼的野草，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59440,
      "end_ms": 62915,
      "text": "彻底打开了杂交水稻研究的大门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00024",
      "start_ms": 63920,
      "end_ms": 64655,
      "text": "三年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65270,
      "end_ms": 66325,
      "text": "一九七三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66880,
      "end_ms": 68820,
      "text": "袁隆平正式宣布，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00027",
      "start_ms": 68880,
      "end_ms": 72890,
      "text": "中国先行杂交水稻三系配套成功，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00028",
      "start_ms": 73050,
      "end_ms": 74705,
      "text": "整个农业界震惊了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00029",
      "start_ms": 75780,
      "end_ms": 76280,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00030",
      "start_ms": 76280,
      "end_ms": 77225,
      "text": "他四十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00031",
      "start_ms": 78220,
      "end_ms": 82885,
      "text": "一九七六年杂交水稻开始在全国大面积推广，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00032",
      "start_ms": 83750,
      "end_ms": 85255,
      "text": "数据是最狠的语言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00033",
      "start_ms": 86210,
      "end_ms": 91670,
      "text": "亩产从普通水稻的三百公斤一路突破五百六百字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00034",
      "start_ms": 92170,
      "end_ms": 95995,
      "text": "后来屡创新高到上世纪末，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00035",
      "start_ms": 96420,
      "end_ms": 99525,
      "text": "中国用不到世界百分之九的耕地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00036",
      "start_ms": 99980,
      "end_ms": 102765,
      "text": "养活了世界百分之二十二的人口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00037",
      "start_ms": 103320,
      "end_ms": 106275,
      "text": "这是震撼世界的伟大奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00038",
      "start_ms": 106880,
      "end_ms": 108825,
      "text": "可当年美国人傲慢的很，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00039",
      "start_ms": 109250,
      "end_ms": 110995,
      "text": "说中国人口太多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00040",
      "start_ms": 111460,
      "end_ms": 113640,
      "text": "没有哪个国家能解决吃饭问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00041",
      "start_ms": 113660,
      "end_ms": 115745,
      "text": "中国人至少一半得饿死。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00042",
      "start_ms": 116130,
      "end_ms": 117825,
      "text": "袁隆平听了没争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00043",
      "start_ms": 118180,
      "end_ms": 119575,
      "text": "一头扎进稻田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00044",
      "start_ms": 120070,
      "end_ms": 121970,
      "text": "最后稻香飘遍神州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00045",
      "start_ms": 122450,
      "end_ms": 124595,
      "text": "老外的断言成了笑话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00046",
      "start_ms": 126760,
      "end_ms": 128080,
      "text": "育种成功之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00047",
      "start_ms": 128500,
      "end_ms": 131140,
      "text": "美国一家种子公司开出天价，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00048",
      "start_ms": 131520,
      "end_ms": 134180,
      "text": "想买杂交水稻的技术专利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00049",
      "start_ms": 134960,
      "end_ms": 136160,
      "text": "袁隆平却拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00050",
      "start_ms": 137100,
      "end_ms": 137600,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00051",
      "start_ms": 138520,
      "end_ms": 139940,
      "text": "这是中国的技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00052",
      "start_ms": 140160,
      "end_ms": 141740,
      "text": "不是我个人的技术，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00053",
      "start_ms": 142020,
      "end_ms": 149740,
      "text": "他反而把技术无偿传授给越南、菲律宾、印度、巴基斯坦等几十个发展中国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00054",
      "start_ms": 150060,
      "end_ms": 150940,
      "text": "有人说他傻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00055",
      "start_ms": 151340,
      "end_ms": 153460,
      "text": "他说饥饿没有国界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00056",
      "start_ms": 153820,
      "end_ms": 155915,
      "text": "种子没有国籍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00057",
      "start_ms": 156590,
      "end_ms": 158510,
      "text": "很多人以为功成名就之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00058",
      "start_ms": 158510,
      "end_ms": 159590,
      "text": "他该退休了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00059",
      "start_ms": 160170,
      "end_ms": 164250,
      "text": "结果呢八十岁还在田里插秧九十岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00060",
      "start_ms": 164410,
      "end_ms": 165990,
      "text": "还天天看天气预报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00061",
      "start_ms": 166490,
      "end_ms": 168190,
      "text": "关心稻田长势。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00062",
      "start_ms": 168430,
      "end_ms": 169390,
      "text": "他有两个梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00063",
      "start_ms": 170110,
      "end_ms": 171370,
      "text": "全世界都知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00064",
      "start_ms": 171530,
      "end_ms": 174650,
      "text": "一个是河下乘凉梦梦见水稻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00065",
      "start_ms": 174790,
      "end_ms": 176390,
      "text": "长得像高粱一样高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00066",
      "start_ms": 177050,
      "end_ms": 179030,
      "text": "穗子像扫帚一样大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00067",
      "start_ms": 179690,
      "end_ms": 182795,
      "text": "他和同事都坐在稻穗下面乘凉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00068",
      "start_ms": 183330,
      "end_ms": 186315,
      "text": "另一个是杂交水稻覆盖全球梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00069",
      "start_ms": 186700,
      "end_ms": 189695,
      "text": "让饥饿从地球上彻底消失。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00070",
      "start_ms": 190450,
      "end_ms": 192750,
      "text": "可你知道他自己过的什么日子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00071",
      "start_ms": 192790,
      "end_ms": 196150,
      "text": "穿十几块钱的衬衫破了补补，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00072",
      "start_ms": 196150,
      "end_ms": 199705,
      "text": "继续穿脚上的皮鞋磨白了还在穿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00073",
      "start_ms": 200660,
      "end_ms": 203510,
      "text": "记者采访时问他他低头看了看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00074",
      "start_ms": 203510,
      "end_ms": 203795,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00075",
      "start_ms": 204220,
      "end_ms": 205265,
      "text": "能走路就行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00076",
      "start_ms": 206460,
      "end_ms": 207475,
      "text": "又不找对象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00077",
      "start_ms": 208040,
      "end_ms": 210165,
      "text": "国家给的上千万奖金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00078",
      "start_ms": 210670,
      "end_ms": 212030,
      "text": "他全部捐出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00079",
      "start_ms": 212030,
      "end_ms": 216540,
      "text": "成立了基金奖励搞农业的年轻的科研。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00080",
      "start_ms": 216540,
      "end_ms": 220555,
      "text": "后辈这辈子没给自己买过一套房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00081",
      "start_ms": 221300,
      "end_ms": 224005,
      "text": "一直住在单位分的老家属楼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00082",
      "start_ms": 224650,
      "end_ms": 226235,
      "text": "他有个雷打不动的习惯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00083",
      "start_ms": 226630,
      "end_ms": 227835,
      "text": "每天天还没亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00084",
      "start_ms": 228290,
      "end_ms": 230520,
      "text": "就打着手电筒去看稻田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00085",
      "start_ms": 230720,
      "end_ms": 231925,
      "text": "看叶子上的露水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00086",
      "start_ms": 232270,
      "end_ms": 233270,
      "text": "看稻穗抽出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00087",
      "start_ms": 233270,
      "end_ms": 234560,
      "text": "没有他管，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00088",
      "start_ms": 234560,
      "end_ms": 236200,
      "text": "这叫跟道子问。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00089",
      "start_ms": 236220,
      "end_ms": 236685,
      "text": "早安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00090",
      "start_ms": 237660,
      "end_ms": 239885,
      "text": "二零二一年五月二十二号，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00091",
      "start_ms": 240270,
      "end_ms": 243385,
      "text": "九十一岁的袁隆平在长沙离世了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244060,
      "end_ms": 245575,
      "text": "就有了开头那一幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00093",
      "start_ms": 246700,
      "end_ms": 248795,
      "text": "老百姓自发涌上街头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00094",
      "start_ms": 249480,
      "end_ms": 250555,
      "text": "捧着菊花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00095",
      "start_ms": 250980,
      "end_ms": 253705,
      "text": "抱着稻穗送他最后一程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00096",
      "start_ms": 254690,
      "end_ms": 259745,
      "text": "他研究的杂交水稻迄今累计推广超过八十亿亩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00097",
      "start_ms": 260340,
      "end_ms": 263145,
      "text": "增产粮食六千多亿公斤。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00098",
      "start_ms": 263870,
      "end_ms": 266785,
      "text": "可他自己的一辈子跟泥土打交道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00099",
      "start_ms": 267280,
      "end_ms": 271815,
      "text": "一辈子在太阳底下弯腰一辈子没为自己活过一天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00100",
      "start_ms": 272340,
      "end_ms": 276975,
      "text": "我们这一代人是有史以来最少挨过饿的中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00101",
      "start_ms": 277640,
      "end_ms": 280395,
      "text": "很多人觉得吃饱饭是理所当然的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281070,
      "end_ms": 283515,
      "text": "可这份理所当然的背后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00103",
      "start_ms": 284090,
      "end_ms": 287255,
      "text": "站着一个弯腰在稻田里度过了一生的老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00104",
      "start_ms": 287770,
      "end_ms": 289235,
      "text": "下次端起碗的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00105",
      "start_ms": 289620,
      "end_ms": 293385,
      "text": "记得他记得那粒种子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00106",
      "start_ms": 293690,
      "end_ms": 294515,
      "text": "记得那个梦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00107",
      "start_ms": 296280,
      "end_ms": 301365,
      "text": "记得那个叫袁隆平的人用一辈子喂饱了一个时代的我们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00108",
      "start_ms": 301940,
      "end_ms": 304340,
      "text": "其实元老只是国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304340,
      "end_ms": 305120,
      "text": "这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00110",
      "start_ms": 305120,
      "end_ms": 308425,
      "text": "四十位科学家中的一位书里还有很多人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00111",
      "start_ms": 308890,
      "end_ms": 309370,
      "text": "名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00112",
      "start_ms": 309370,
      "end_ms": 311010,
      "text": "你可能头一回听说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00113",
      "start_ms": 311510,
      "end_ms": 314610,
      "text": "有人隐姓埋名几十年搞原子弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00114",
      "start_ms": 315090,
      "end_ms": 317350,
      "text": "有人在废井里捞秧苗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00115",
      "start_ms": 317830,
      "end_ms": 320890,
      "text": "有人把国家讲的房子改成实验室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00116",
      "start_ms": 321470,
      "end_ms": 324630,
      "text": "他们干的是惊天动地过的日子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00117",
      "start_ms": 324630,
      "end_ms": 329450,
      "text": "普普通通这本书不是什么高高在上的名人传记，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00118",
      "start_ms": 329910,
      "end_ms": 331590,
      "text": "是四十个普通人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00119",
      "start_ms": 332270,
      "end_ms": 334170,
      "text": "用一辈子告诉你一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00120",
      "start_ms": 334690,
      "end_ms": 335790,
      "text": "人这一辈子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00121",
      "start_ms": 335970,
      "end_ms": 337350,
      "text": "该为什么活着。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00122",
      "start_ms": 337950,
      "end_ms": 338700,
      "text": "家里有孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00123",
      "start_ms": 338760,
      "end_ms": 340360,
      "text": "孩子的让他也读一读。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00124",
      "start_ms": 340760,
      "end_ms": 342740,
      "text": "如果你也被元老感动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00125",
      "start_ms": 342740,
      "end_ms": 344360,
      "text": "点个关注点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00126",
      "start_ms": 344800,
      "end_ms": 347300,
      "text": "收藏起来转发给身边的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00127",
      "start_ms": 348140,
      "end_ms": 351540,
      "text": "想把这四十个故事带回家的点击下方链接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00128",
      "start_ms": 351740,
      "end_ms": 353460,
      "text": "就是这本国之脊梁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00129",
      "start_ms": 354820,
      "end_ms": 356980,
      "text": "评论区留下一句元老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00130",
      "start_ms": 358760,
      "end_ms": 359680,
      "text": "一路走好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_21f58ae8ccf2ac26_s00131",
      "start_ms": 360160,
      "end_ms": 361450,
      "text": "算给老人家回个礼。"
    }
  ],
